Sorry for making you worry.

00:02:09.172 --> 00:02:11.883
It's okay. I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:02:12.091 --> 00:02:14.510
Seriously. Isn't it a relief, Haruki?

00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:16.304
Yeah.

00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:19.349
Mashiki, I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:20.642
Yeah.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:23.436
You two seem to be getting along.

00:02:23.645 --> 00:02:25.980
Did we get in the way?

00:02:26.189 --> 00:02:27.982
Honda-kun.

00:02:31.194 --> 00:02:32.862
Thank you for everything.

00:02:33.071 --> 00:02:37.325
You should have the surgery done
soon for your friends' sake, too.

00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:38.576
Yeah...

00:02:38.785 --> 00:02:40.453
What's wrong?

00:02:40.662 --> 00:02:43.873
| have to have surgery, right?

00:02:44.082 --> 00:02:46.209
Yes.

00:02:46.417 --> 00:02:48.711
It'll make you better.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.046
Yeah.

00:02:50.254 --> 00:02:52.131
You can come back when it's over.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:53.424
It'll only be for a little while.

00:02:53.633 --> 00:02:54.759
Huh?

00:02:54.967 --> 00:02:58.262
Miharu's being transferred to
another hospital outside of Tokyo.

00:02:58.471 --> 00:03:00.556
Transferred?

00:03:02.975 --> 00:03:04.519
Yeah.

00:03:11.984 --> 00:03:13.903
| can't believe she's taking time off school.

00:03:14.112 --> 00:03:17.907
She can't help it. It's for her surgery.

00:03:19.283 --> 00:03:22.912
You're not the only one who
doesn't want her to go.

00:03:33.798 --> 00:03:35.883
I'll be back.

00:03:36.092 --> 00:03:38.928
Sure. We'll come with--

00:03:41.013 --> 00:03:42.724
Say "hi" to Mashiki-san for us.

00:03:42.932 --> 00:03:44.517
Sure.

00:03:49.564 --> 00:03:51.190
Mashi--

00:04:03.828 --> 00:04:07.206
Towa, you go on ahead.

00:04:11.127 --> 00:04:13.087
Mashiki.

00:04:13.296 --> 00:04:16.799
We were thinking about leaving soon.

00:04:17.008 --> 00:04:18.134
Thanks for coming again.

00:04:18.342 --> 00:04:19.802
Take care.

00:04:20.011 --> 00:04:21.679
We will.

00:04:27.685 --> 00:04:29.562
| see.

00:04:29.771 --> 00:04:32.899
She's been holding it in this whole time.

00:04:33.107 --> 00:04:37.403
But I couldn't say anything...

00:04:38.404 --> 00:04:40.031
...again.

00:04:42.617 --> 00:04:45.036
Then tell her.

00:04:45.244 --> 00:04:48.372
So she doesn't have to
hide her tears anymore.

00:04:48.581 --> 00:04:51.667
You're the only one who can do it.

00:04:52.794 --> 00:04:55.046
You don't have much time.

00:04:55.254 --> 00:04:59.467
Yeah. I know.

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:34.460
Is this okay?

00:05:34.669 --> 00:05:35.962
I'm impressed you knew.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.213
| remembered.

00:05:37.421 --> 00:05:39.131
Thanks.

00:05:44.095 --> 00:05:45.888
It's warm.

00:06:01.362 --> 00:06:03.322
So, uh...

00:06:03.531 --> 00:06:05.491
-]--
--Oh, Mashiki-san!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.577
Is your mother coming today?

00:06:07.785 --> 00:06:09.161
| think she's coming by later.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.789
Really? Oh, is this your boyfriend?

00:06:11.998 --> 00:06:13.541
What?

00:06:13.749 --> 00:06:15.251
He's a friend from school.

00:06:15.459 --> 00:06:20.423
Huh. Well, have your mother come to
the nurse's station when she gets here.

00:06:20.631 --> 00:06:22.800
| have some transfer forms
for her to fill out.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.009
"Aokisora General Hospital" | have
some transfer forms for her to fill out.

00:06:23.009 --> 00:06:23.217
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:06:23.217 --> 00:06:24.594
"Aokisora General Hospital"
I will.

00:06:24.594 --> 00:06:24.802
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:06:24.802 --> 00:06:26.387
"Aokisora General Hospital"
Bye.

00:06:26.387 --> 00:06:27.221
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:06:27.221 --> 00:06:27.972
"Aokisora General Hospital"
Sorry.

00:06:27.972 --> 00:06:28.180
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.974
"Aokisora General Hospital"
It's okay.

00:06:29.974 --> 00:06:30.016
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:06:30.182 --> 00:06:33.144
How much longer are you staying?

00:06:34.562 --> 00:06:37.023
Until the week after next.

00:07:06.552 --> 00:07:08.012
That sounds like Mihashi-san.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.180
And Towa's being Towa.

00:07:09.388 --> 00:07:11.682
He's totally under her thrall.

00:07:11.891 --> 00:07:13.809
| envy them.

00:07:14.018 --> 00:07:18.397
| wish I could go to school with you, too.

00:07:20.608 --> 00:07:22.109
Yeah.

00:07:27.823 --> 00:07:34.163
Uh, so... about the other day...

00:07:35.498 --> 00:07:41.462
| was thinking about waiting
until after you got out, but...

00:07:44.256 --> 00:07:46.258
Mashiki?

00:07:50.888 --> 00:07:53.015
-]--
--You're wrong.

00:07:53.224 --> 00:07:55.351
It's not me.

00:07:58.145 --> 00:08:01.565
That girl you met a long time ago...

00:08:01.774 --> 00:08:05.486
That girl you've always cared for...

00:08:05.695 --> 00:08:06.570
It wasn't--

00:08:06.779 --> 00:08:07.780
| know.

00:08:07.989 --> 00:08:09.532
Huh?

00:08:14.537 --> 00:08:20.084
The girl I've always had my eye on...

00:08:20.292 --> 00:08:23.504
The Mashiki I know...

00:08:23.713 --> 00:08:29.635
The girl I'm talking to now...

00:08:33.931 --> 00:08:37.727
...is Mashiki Miharu.

00:08:43.858 --> 00:08:46.152
I'm scared.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.821
Of the surgery?

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.240
| heard he's a really good surgeo--

00:08:51.449 --> 00:08:56.620
| know. I know, but...

00:08:56.829 --> 00:09:01.792
...Misora didn't come home.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.547
There's a chance...

00:09:06.756 --> 00:09:11.802
There's a chance I won't be
able to see everyone again.

00:09:12.011 --> 00:09:15.973
That we'll never see each other again.

00:09:18.267 --> 00:09:22.104
When I think about it, I get scared.

00:09:25.024 --> 00:09:28.819
So I can't.

00:09:31.655 --> 00:09:33.657
I'm sorry.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.552
"Certain Victory"

00:10:58.325 --> 00:11:00.244
Mishima, nice time.

00:11:00.452 --> 00:11:02.121
Keep it up.

00:11:02.329 --> 00:11:03.956
Got it.

00:11:07.084 --> 00:11:09.003
Uh, Senpai. I gotta go again.

00:11:09.211 --> 00:11:11.714
Sure. Good work today.

00:11:13.424 --> 00:11:16.177
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:11:32.526 --> 00:11:34.320
No running!

00:11:34.528 --> 00:11:36.113
Sorry!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.743
| made it.

00:11:46.582 --> 00:11:49.710
Mishima-kun, you're sweating.

00:11:49.919 --> 00:11:52.922
I'm okay.

00:11:56.383 --> 00:11:59.136
I-I can do it myself.

00:11:59.345 --> 00:12:01.222
It's fine.

00:12:07.478 --> 00:12:09.980
What's going to happen to them?

00:12:10.189 --> 00:12:12.316
What will be, will be.

00:12:12.524 --> 00:12:15.611
But what about Mashiki-san?

00:12:15.819 --> 00:12:18.322
He won't give up on her.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:20.616
He's been chasing her this whole time.

00:12:20.824 --> 00:12:23.077
He won't stop now.

00:12:23.285 --> 00:12:25.913
That's what I believe.

00:12:27.957 --> 00:12:29.208
Yeah.

00:12:29.416 --> 00:12:32.127
Mashiki-san's probably the same way.

00:12:34.838 --> 00:12:37.591
They'll be fine.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:40.844
Yeah, I'm sure they will be.

00:12:51.814 --> 00:12:53.816
"The hospital is closed
to visitors for the day."

00:13:17.298 --> 00:13:19.216
Mishima-kun!

00:13:21.844 --> 00:13:24.179
Mashiki, should you be running?

00:13:24.388 --> 00:13:30.602
But I saw... you... so I...

00:13:39.028 --> 00:13:41.113
Thanks.

00:13:54.126 --> 00:13:56.378
| got a starting spot on the team.

00:13:56.587 --> 00:13:58.088
It's just a small meet, though.

00:13:58.297 --> 00:14:00.466
That's amazing. Congratulations.

00:14:00.674 --> 00:14:02.634
When's the meet?

00:14:05.137 --> 00:14:07.931
The week after next.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:12.102
| see. I won't be able to go see you.

00:14:12.311 --> 00:14:15.731
I'm going to be busier with practice.

00:14:15.939 --> 00:14:18.525
| may not be able to come visit anymore.

00:14:18.734 --> 00:14:20.235
Yeah.

00:14:21.487 --> 00:14:24.239
Or see you when you get out.

00:14:24.448 --> 00:14:25.908
Yeah.

00:14:29.787 --> 00:14:31.872
Mashiki.

00:14:32.081 --> 00:14:36.543
| won't lose. I'll do my best!

00:14:36.752 --> 00:14:37.461
Yeah.

00:14:37.669 --> 00:14:42.383
So... You do your best, too!

00:14:43.717 --> 00:14:45.844
| will.

00:14:52.518 --> 00:14:55.521
"Aokisora General Hospital"

00:14:57.606 --> 00:14:59.316
It's tomorrow morning, right?

00:14:59.525 --> 00:15:02.194
--Yeah.
--Sorry we can't see you off.

00:15:02.403 --> 00:15:07.157
That's okay. You already came to see me.

00:15:13.372 --> 00:15:14.581
Sorry.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:18.168
| told him to come.

00:15:20.629 --> 00:15:23.257
Take your marks.

00:15:27.261 --> 00:15:29.012
It's fine.

00:15:29.221 --> 00:15:33.809
But I wish I could've gone to cheer him on.

00:15:34.017 --> 00:15:35.561
Mashiki.

00:15:36.937 --> 00:15:37.813
Here.

00:15:38.021 --> 00:15:38.897
Huh?

00:15:38.897 --> 00:15:39.565
"The Merman Prince"
Huh?

00:15:39.565 --> 00:15:39.773
"The Merman Prince"

00:15:39.773 --> 00:15:40.774
"The Merman Prince"
This book...

00:15:40.774 --> 00:15:40.899
"The Merman Prince"

00:15:40.983 --> 00:15:42.901
It's from Haruki.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.112
Take it.

00:15:52.786 --> 00:15:54.455
Dear Mashiki,

00:15:55.664 --> 00:15:58.125
Sorry I couldn't visit you today.

00:15:58.333 --> 00:16:03.672
But there's something I have to tell you.

00:16:03.881 --> 00:16:09.428
Because of this picture book,
| was able to enjoy swimming.

00:16:09.636 --> 00:16:12.389
I've swum so much to make it this far.

00:16:12.598 --> 00:16:17.102
It hasn't just helped me with
swimming, but with you, too.

00:16:17.311 --> 00:16:20.981
This picture book gives me courage.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.443
| want you to have that courage.

00:16:24.651 --> 00:16:27.446
Good luck, Mashiki!

00:16:31.658 --> 00:16:33.118
Come in.

00:16:33.327 --> 00:16:34.536
Are you ready?

00:16:34.745 --> 00:16:35.412
Yeah.

00:16:35.621 --> 00:16:37.539
You should go to bed.

00:16:37.748 --> 00:16:41.043
Okay. Good night.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:48.217
"Winner"

00:16:55.307 --> 00:16:58.560
"Mashiki Mi"

00:17:01.104 --> 00:17:05.901
"Drawn by the moonlight, the prince
stuck his head out of the water.

00:17:06.109 --> 00:17:11.198
His eyes were drawn to the girl
standing at the top of the cliff.

00:17:11.406 --> 00:17:15.160
She looked very, very sad.

00:17:15.369 --> 00:17:18.622
'Why is she crying?'"

00:17:19.665 --> 00:17:24.962
"Every day, the prince watched the girl."

00:17:29.716 --> 00:17:34.972
"One day the prince saw
the girl leaving on a boat.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.516
Far, far across the ocean,

00:17:37.724 --> 00:17:42.771
he saw pearls of tears falling
from the girl's eyes.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:48.277
The boat grew smaller and
smaller as it sailed away.

00:17:48.485 --> 00:17:50.862
'I probably won't be
able to see her again.'

00:17:51.071 --> 00:17:53.323
The prince became very sad.

00:17:53.532 --> 00:17:56.285
'I don't want that!""

00:17:57.536 --> 00:17:59.621
"The prince started swimming.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:05.502
He pumped his little tail and
chased after the little boat.

00:18:05.711 --> 00:18:08.171
A school of little fish got in his way.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.716
'Move, move! I can't see where I'm going!"

00:18:10.924 --> 00:18:15.345
But the prince kept chasing the boat.

00:18:15.554 --> 00:18:17.556
The night sky was pitch black.

00:18:17.764 --> 00:18:20.934
<i>...I'm not scared. I'm fine...'</i>

00:18:21.143 --> 00:18:24.730
But the prince kept chasing the boat.

00:18:24.938 --> 00:18:27.065
The prince became very hungry.

00:18:27.274 --> 00:18:29.818
'No, I can't! I'll be eaten!"

00:18:30.027 --> 00:18:32.779
But the prince kept chasing the boat."

00:18:34.197 --> 00:18:36.617
"A giant fish stood in his way.

00:18:36.825 --> 00:18:38.076
'You won't beat me.'

00:18:38.285 --> 00:18:42.080
But the prince kept chasing the boat.

00:18:42.289 --> 00:18:44.875
It started raining and a storm came.

00:18:45.083 --> 00:18:47.628
The mean waves tried to push him back.

00:18:47.836 --> 00:18:50.839
'You won't beat me. You won't beat me.'

00:18:51.048 --> 00:18:54.176
But the prince kept chasing the boat."

00:19:02.184 --> 00:19:05.437
"The Merman Prince"

00:19:37.219 --> 00:19:44.059
"Every day the little prince swam
as hard as he could without rest.

00:19:44.267 --> 00:19:46.103
At the end of his long, long journey,

00:19:46.311 --> 00:19:48.939
having finally caught up to the girl's ship,

00:19:49.147 --> 00:19:53.443
the prince gathered his strength
and swam up beside it.

00:19:53.652 --> 00:19:59.324
'Don't cry anymore. I'm here to rescue
you,' said the prince to the girl.

00:19:59.533 --> 00:20:04.788
'Your eyes glitter like coral.
They're beautiful.'

00:20:04.996 --> 00:20:09.668
The girl answered, 'Where is the coral?"

00:20:09.876 --> 00:20:12.587
'At the bottom of the blue sea.'

00:20:12.796 --> 00:20:15.048
'I'd like to see it.'

00:20:15.257 --> 00:20:17.467
'Then come with me!'

00:20:17.676 --> 00:20:21.888
Working up his courage,
the prince held out his hand."

00:20:24.516 --> 00:20:26.351
| won't let it beat me.

00:20:28.019 --> 00:20:31.064
| won't lose. I'll do my best.

00:20:31.273 --> 00:20:33.150
Mashiki.

00:20:34.359 --> 00:20:39.197
So what you said to me before...

00:20:39.406 --> 00:20:41.408
I---

00:20:42.784 --> 00:20:44.369
I---

00:20:45.579 --> 00:20:47.164
Mashiki.

00:20:47.372 --> 00:20:49.291
I'll say it.

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:57.382
I'm in love with--

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:39.382
"And this is where their story begins."

00:21:44.513 --> 00:21:53.021
Another city light blinks out

00:21:53.230 --> 00:22:02.864
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:03.073 --> 00:22:11.581
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:20.715
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:20.924 --> 00:22:25.387
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:25.595 --> 00:22:31.434
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:32.561 --> 00:22:41.528
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:22:41.736 --> 00:22:50.871
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:22:51.079 --> 00:23:04.634
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:04.843 --> 00:23:11.182
Call that happiness
